{"2191500": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vampires: Bloodlord Rising", "steam_appid": 2191500, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [4234790, 4234800, 4259810, 4234780], "detailed_description": "<h1>Roadmap</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/005accf026942cbcdb474d091cd5ce5e.avif?t=1788250742\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras_big/005accf026942cbcdb474d091cd5ce5e.webp?t=1788250742 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Dragos. A survivor of a vampire attack, turned into a creature of the night. Roam the <strong>open world</strong> of medieval Sangavia and forge a powerful <strong>Vampire Dominion</strong>. Build your <strong>castle</strong>, turn <strong>villagers into servants</strong> and explore a <strong>vast gothic-inspired open world</strong>. Whether you <strong>play solo or in co-op</strong>, your choices define your legacy. Will you reign from a palace of terror, or become the lord your people need?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/17f45c500be54d044dc66c437acf10d9.avif?t=1788250742\" width=1500 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE A DARK, OPEN WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.poster.avif?t=1788250742\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/a4baa692e6badc45c18fb21e546ea651.webm?t=1788250742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You awaken from slumber as a weakened vampire lord in the cursed land of Sangavia. <strong>Rebuild your fallen castle</strong>. Its heart, the <strong>Castle Core</strong>, is still pulsing with ancient hunger. <strong>Fuel the Core with blood</strong> to <strong>unlock new regions</strong>, <strong>discover hidden areas</strong> shrouded in mist, and <strong>reclaim your power</strong> in a <strong>dark action-adventure</strong> with <strong>castle building</strong>, <strong>exploration</strong> and <strong>RPG elements</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1788250742\" width=50 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>BUILD YOUR DREAM CASTLE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.poster.avif?t=1788250742\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.webm?t=1788250742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/8332b09779e29819980b209271412d74.mp4?t=1788250742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rebuild your fortress</strong> and shape it to your will - towering halls, secret chambers, and gothic spires rising from the night. Your castle is your refuge, your power, and the true symbol of your <strong>growing dominion</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1788250742\" width=50 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>GROW YOUR VAMPIRE FOLLOWING</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/827d363fa7a9ac931ed5d28db32153b9.poster.avif?t=1788250742\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/827d363fa7a9ac931ed5d28db32153b9.webm?t=1788250742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is filled with prey. <strong>Feed on humans and beasts</strong> that roam the night to <strong>regain your strength</strong> and fuel your <strong>dark rituals</strong>. Command loyal <strong>vampire thralls</strong> to serve your will - from <strong>crafting</strong>, <strong>hunting</strong>, and <strong>building</strong> to protecting your <strong>dark empire</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1788250742\" width=50 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CO-OP MULTIPLAYER</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.poster.avif?t=1788250742\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.webm?t=1788250742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/da2dffd4e1befe28ea0769eb8c28b009.mp4?t=1788250742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a Child of the Night, you don’t have to be alone. <strong>Invite your friends to rule the land as equals</strong> and see where your individual decisions lead you. Unleash your creativity when you <strong>build your castle together</strong>. Explore the grim, sinister and bloody Sangavia as a team and face the dangers waiting in the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/7b64f43091e874bc0238bf35436de8ed.webp?t=1788250742\" width=50 height=28 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>SURVIVE AS A VAMPIRE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.poster.avif?t=1788250742\" width=780 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.webm?t=1788250742\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/d2cdad81fafb8a5dcc5b6d51ce33c739.mp4?t=1788250742\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To <strong>survive the night</strong>, you must evolve your <strong>vampiric abilities</strong> through an intricate <strong>skill tree</strong> and embrace the forms that shape your legacy. Shift between the <strong>Aristocrat</strong> and <strong>Hunter</strong> forms, or <strong>transform into a bat</strong> to roam the skies and uncover distant lands. Power invites resistance, and the <strong>Inquisition</strong> will never stop hunting you. Crush their holy warriors in brutal, <strong>skill-based combat</strong> to defend your vampire reign.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/17f45c500be54d044dc66c437acf10d9.avif?t=1788250742\" width=1500 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Feed the Castle Core, awaken forgotten power, and uncover the secrets of Sangavia. Rule the night alone, or rise alongside up to three allies in 4-player co-op.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Dragos. A survivor of a vampire attack, turned into a creature of the night. Roam the <strong>open world</strong> of medieval Sangavia and forge a powerful <strong>Vampire Dominion</strong>. Build your <strong>castle</strong>, turn <strong>villagers into servants</strong> and explore a <strong>vast gothic-inspired open world</strong>. Whether you <strong>play solo or in co-op</strong>, your choices define your legacy. Will you reign from a palace of terror, or become the lord your people need?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2191500/extras/17f45c500be54d044dc66c437acf10d9.avif?t=1788250742\" width=1500 height=71 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>EXPLORE A DARK, OPEN WORLD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay m